<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Imsa prices IPO at $19 per ADS.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Imsa prices IPO at $19 per ADS.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Monterrey-based industrial company Grupo Imsa SA de CV said on Tuesday it had set a price of $19 per ADS as part of a global initial public offering.</p>
<p>The American Depositary Shares on offer &quot;will begin trading on the New York Stock Exchange on December 11, 1996,&quot; Imsa said in a statement.</p>
</text>
